{"seq":4,"slug":"major-works","title":"彼得·德鲁克·major-works","stage":"DONE","category":"peter-drucker","categoryLabel":"彼得·德鲁克","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/peter-drucker/major-works","rating":{"composite":3.69,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/28_peter-drucker/4_major-works","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"德鲁克-主要著作\">德鲁克·主要著作</h1><p>彼得·德鲁克（1909–2005）一生著作约三十九部，跨越管理学、社会学、政治学与经济学。本 hub 不复述他的思想本身，而是<strong>逐部解剖他最重要的几部著作</strong>——每本书的成书背景、核心命题、历史定位与常见误读，让读者知道&quot;该读哪本、为什么读、怎么读&quot;。这是进入德鲁克思想最具体的一扇门。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><p>德鲁克专题下有六个 hub。本 hub（主要著作）以&quot;书&quot;为单位展开，与其余五个的边界如下，避免重复：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>兄弟 hub</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">1_生平与时代</a></td>\n<td>他的人生经历</td>\n<td>本 hub 只在交代成书背景时引用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">2_核心贡献</a></td>\n<td>他确立的学科与核心理念</td>\n<td>本 hub 把著作当证据，不抽象论贡献</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">3_思想与方法</a></td>\n<td>具体命题怎么做</td>\n<td>本 hub 给&quot;哪本书提出了它&quot;，3 给&quot;具体怎么用&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>4_主要著作（本 hub）</strong></td>\n<td>各部著作的成书、内容、定位</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">5_影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>著作产生的实际后果</td>\n<td>本 hub 讲书本身，5 讲它的影响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">6_争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>对其思想的批评</td>\n<td>本 hub 给建构，6 给批判</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一条贯穿原则：<strong>同一思想只在&quot;提出它的那本书&quot;里展开</strong>，方法层面的深挖一律交给兄弟 hub <a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a> 与 <a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a>，本 hub 用相对链接指过去而不重复。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[公司的概念 1946&lt;br/&gt;奠基·田野调查] --&gt; B[管理的实践 1954&lt;br/&gt;学科诞生]&#10;    B --&gt; C[管理:任务责任实践 1973&lt;br/&gt;集大成圣经]&#10;    C --&gt; D[卓有成效的管理者 1966&lt;br/&gt;管理自己]&#10;    B --&gt; E[创新与企业家精神 1985&lt;br/&gt;创新作为实践]&#10;    A --&gt; F[晚期著作与社会思想&lt;br/&gt;社会生态学家]&#10;    C --&gt; F\">graph LR\n    A[公司的概念 1946&lt;br/&gt;奠基·田野调查] --&gt; B[管理的实践 1954&lt;br/&gt;学科诞生]\n    B --&gt; C[管理:任务责任实践 1973&lt;br/&gt;集大成圣经]\n    C --&gt; D[卓有成效的管理者 1966&lt;br/&gt;管理自己]\n    B --&gt; E[创新与企业家精神 1985&lt;br/&gt;创新作为实践]\n    A --&gt; F[晚期著作与社会思想&lt;br/&gt;社会生态学家]\n    C --&gt; F</pre><ol>\n<li><a href=\"foundational-works/concept-of-the-corporation\">公司的概念</a> — 起点：第一部把企业当社会组织研究的书，先读。</li>\n<li><a href=\"foundational-works/the-practice-of-management\">管理的实践</a> — 现代管理学的诞生标志，&quot;创造顾客&quot;&quot;目标管理&quot;出处。</li>\n<li><a href=\"the-magnum-opus/management-tasks-responsibilities\">管理：任务、责任、实践</a> — 集大成&quot;圣经&quot;，当工具书查阅。</li>\n<li><a href=\"the-magnum-opus/the-effective-executive-book\">卓有成效的管理者</a> — 最薄最畅销，讲&quot;如何管理自己&quot;。</li>\n<li><a href=\"influential-writings/innovation-and-entrepreneurship-book\">创新与企业家精神</a> — 把创新变成可学的实践，七大来源。</li>\n<li><a href=\"influential-writings/later-writings\">晚期著作与社会思想</a> — 从反极权到知识社会，看懂&quot;社会生态学家&quot;。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"前置与延伸\">前置与延伸</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>前置</strong>：无需管理学背景。若想先了解各书的传记语境（维也纳、逃离纳粹、通用汽车研究），可浏览 <a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>读完之后</strong>：想把书里的命题落到方法，转 <a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a>；想看这些书产生的实际影响，转 <a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a>；想看对它们的批评，转 <a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundational-works","title":"Foundational Works","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/peter-drucker/major-works/foundational-works","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"concept-of-the-corporation","title":"《公司的概念》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/peter-drucker/major-works/foundational-works/concept-of-the-corporation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-practice-of-management","title":"《管理的实践》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/peter-drucker/major-works/foundational-works/the-practice-of-management"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-magnum-opus","title":"The Magnum Opus","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/peter-drucker/major-works/the-magnum-opus","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"management-tasks-responsibilities","title":"《管理：任务、责任、实践》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/peter-drucker/major-works/the-magnum-opus/management-tasks-responsibilities"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-effective-executive-book","title":"《卓有成效的管理者》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/peter-drucker/major-works/the-magnum-opus/the-effective-executive-book"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"influential-writings","title":"Influential Writings","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/peter-drucker/major-works/influential-writings","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"innovation-and-entrepreneurship-book","title":"《创新与企业家精神》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/peter-drucker/major-works/influential-writings/innovation-and-entrepreneurship-book"},{"seq":2,"slug":"later-writings","title":"晚期著作与社会思想","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/peter-drucker/major-works/influential-writings/later-writings"}]}]}